--- /dev/null
+++ b/AUDIT-MODIFICATIONS.md
@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+Unofficial local experiment based on Telemt 3.5.5 (ac71d92ec41dea00a7eafd6b8d350c3486633500).
+
+Changes: flush pending relay output before waiting for further source input, preserving existing adaptive buffers, cryptography, wire formats, quotas and connection handling.
+
+No endorsement by Telemt maintainers. Original LICENSE and attribution are retained. This build is not a production release.
+
+Second experimental build also preserves kernel TCP automatic send/receive buffer selection on client-facing and Direct outgoing relay sockets. Fallback socket configuration is retained. This may increase kernel socket memory under load and requires separate pressure validation.
